  "final_message": "Renewal invoices should now show the reported quantity for metered prices. The 24 existing tests pass, but I didn't add a test that reproduces the bug.\n\nThe root cause was a unit mismatch in `records_in_period` in `billing/usage.py`. Usage records are timestamped in epoch milliseconds, but the billing period bounds are epoch seconds. The function compared them directly, so almost no usage fell inside the period and the aggregated quantity came out as 0. I fixed it by converting both period bounds with `to_millis` before comparing.\n\nI also wrote `answer.json` in the repository root:\n\n```json\n{\"file\": \"usage.py\", \"function\": \"records_in_period\"}\n```",
